    <string name="set_privacy">No account, no internet, no ads. Tales, drawings and recordings stay on this phone.</string>
    <string name="set_propp">The grown-up\'s hints follow the steps Vladimir Propp found in folk tales, shortened for bedtime. The cut-outs are made in the manner of Lotte Reiniger\'s shadow films.</string>
    <string name="welcome_1">A magic lantern</string>
    <string name="welcome_1_sub">Light it, and slides of painted glass come out: a hero, a place, a magic thing, a trouble. Nobody knows who it\'ll be.</string>
    <string name="welcome_2">Make it up together</string>
    <string name="welcome_2_sub">Lay the phone face down and tell the tale with the child. Turn it over when you need a twist.</string>
    <string name="welcome_3">A quiet ending</string>
    <string name="welcome_3_sub">A candle tells you when to finish. Then the tale goes on the shelf, and the lantern goes out to the sound of rain.</string>
